# Normalize line endings so `npm run lint` is a real gate on every platform.
#
# Git stores LF and `core.autocrlf=true` was checking out CRLF, which made
# `npm run lint` report ~1000 `Delete ␍` errors on Windows and zero on CI.
# See AGENTS.md; this file is what makes that note obsolete.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
